  "prefLabel": "En 1009.01 Supplemental Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1009.01 Supplemental Review. If the applicant agrees to undergo supplemental review, it shall notify the utility and submit a fee for supplemental review in accordance with the timeline specified in En 1007.05 or En 1008.05. The supplemental review fee shall be utility specific and designed to recover all costs associated with the supplemental review process, shall be based upon the applicant’s facility export capacity, and may consist of a fixed fee in whole or in part.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
